function the cad mesh of {cad body:bodyValue} with maximum angle {a number:requestedAngle} within {a number:requestedTolerance}:
    execute:
        set maxAngle to the cad sampling angle for (requestedAngle as a 64 bit floating-point number)
        set tolerance to requestedTolerance as a 64 bit floating-point number
        if ((tolerance > 0.0) and ((the absolute value of tolerance) <= 1.7976931348623157e308)) = false:
