                set previousValue's active to false
                replace item at index previousIndex in openValues with previousValue
                return nothing
        set newIndex to the length of openValues
        append (@intrinsic("construct", a cad open silhouette side, true, storedFirst, storedSecond, normalValue)) to openValues
        put cad pair value newIndex for key firstKey and secondKey in sideTable

local function the cad silhouette normal at {integer:vertexIndex} in {cad mesh:meshValue} otherwise {cad vector3:fallbackValue}:
    execute:
        if (vertexIndex >= 0) and (vertexIndex < (the length of meshValue's normals)):
            set normalResult to the cad normalization of (the item at vertexIndex in meshValue's normals)
            if normalResult's valid:
                return normalResult's value
        return fallbackValue

local function the cad silhouette source from {cad mesh:meshValue} with groups {a pointer to a list:groupValues}, included {a pointer to a list:includedValues} within {a 64 bit floating-point number:requestedPrecision}:
